<title>JAPAN: NTT shares surge to 1997 high.</title>
<headline>NTT shares surge to 1997 high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of telecommunications giant Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) hit a record high for this calendar year in Tuesday afternoon trade, as investor interest grew in domestic demand-related issues, traders said.</p>
<p>NTT's shares briefly hit 1,020,000 yen, the highest figure so far this year.</p>
<p>At 0525 GMT, the share was up 7,000 yen at 1,000,000.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 21,843 shares.</p>
</text>
